Subject: [PATCH 03/13] customkimi: add /wipe-all-sessions command

Delete every saved session across all workspaces through the harness session API. Requires '/wipe-all-sessions confirm'; without it only a warning is shown. If the current session is among those deleted, a fresh session starts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
